@proiectMTP_HostAddress = http://localhost:5015

### Register a new professor account
POST {{proiectMTP_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ada Lovelace",
  "email": "ada@example.com",
  "password": "secret123"
}

### Login with an existing account
POST {{proiectMTP_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ada@example.com",
  "password": "secret123"
}

###
